sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student (web UI)
    actor AD as Admin (web UI)
    participant G as API Gateway (Traefik)
    participant A as Auth
    participant W as Wallet
    participant B as Booking
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notification

    Note over S,N: REST = solid arrow, gRPC = labelled "gRPC", event = labelled "AMQP", local DB step = note box

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over S,B: Phase 1 · Student opens a dispute (freezes the tutor earning)
    S->>G: REST POST /api/disputes (bookingId, reason, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>A: REST forward-auth: verify session and STUDENT capability
    A-->>G: signed actor assertion
    G->>W: REST request + actor assertion + gateway credential
    W->>B: gRPC getBookingEvidence (booking id)
    B-->>W: owner, status, start and end time
    Note over W: Claim window check: not PAYMENT_DUE, lesson already started,<br/>cancelled booking within 24 h after its end
    Note over W: Local DB transaction (PostgreSQL wallet_db): lock the booking's<br/>financial record, insert dispute OPEN and audit row,<br/>set dispute_held, outbox rows dispute-opened and dispute-held
    alt Hold committed
        W-->>S: 201 dispute (earning held)
    else Earning already cleared, nothing left to refund, or dispute exists
        W-->>S: 409 DISPUTE_WINDOW_CLOSED, NO_REFUNDABLE_AMOUNT or DISPUTE_EXISTS
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 250, 240)
    Note over W,W: Race with the clearing worker (same row lock, either order is safe)
    W->>W: clearing sweep: lock financial record, 24 h after tutor confirmation
    alt Dispute committed first
        Note over W: dispute_held is true, so clearing is SKIPPED
    else Clearing committed first
        Note over W: status SETTLED, tutor paid once, later dispute opens fail with 409
    end
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over AD,B: Phase 2 · Admin reviews the case
    AD->>G: REST GET /api/admin/disputes/{id}
    G->>W: REST request + actor assertion (after forward-auth, ADMIN capability)
    W->>B: gRPC getBookingEvidence (current booking state)
    W->>A: gRPC lookupAccounts (student and tutor names)
    B-->>W: booking evidence
    A-->>W: display names
    W-->>AD: 200 dispute, booking, financial record, ledger entries, ETag
    end

    rect rgb(255, 236, 236)
    Note over AD,W: Phase 3 · Admin decides
    AD->>G: REST POST /api/admin/disputes/{id}/decision (decision, reason, If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>W: REST request + actor assertion (after forward-auth)
    Note over W: Local DB transaction: lock financial record, then the dispute,<br/>must still be OPEN and revision must match
    alt APPROVE_FULL_REMAINDER
        Note over W: Same transaction: refund paid minus already refunded to the student wallet,<br/>once per dispute id, remove pending earning and fee,<br/>audit row, outbox rows refund-applied and dispute-decided
        W-->>AD: 200 dispute APPROVED, refundedAmount
    else REJECT
        Note over W: Same transaction: release the hold only, no money moves,<br/>clearing deadline unchanged, audit row, outbox row dispute-decided
        W-->>AD: 200 dispute REJECTED
    else Already decided or revision changed
        W-->>AD: 409 DISPUTE_ALREADY_DECIDED or 412 REVISION_MISMATCH
    end
    end

    rect rgb(243, 235, 255)
    Note over W,N: Phase 4 · Notify the people involved (asynchronous, after commit)
    W-)Q: AMQP publish dispute-opened (admins), dispute-held, dispute-decided, refund-applied
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver events
    Note over N: Dedupe, create jobs for student, tutor and admins (simulated delivery)
    end
